<title>DENMARK: Norway's Statkraft raises four-pct bond offer.</title>
<headline>Norway's Statkraft raises four-pct bond offer.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statkraft SF on Monday raised an existing 800 million crown, four-percent, six-year bond offer to 1.1 billion crowns, lead manager Den Danske Bank said in a statement distributed by the Copenhagen Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The bond matures on December 5, 2002 and the initial issue was listed on Copenhagen Bourse on December 5 this year. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
